  <h4 class="modal-section-title">Three years, built together</h4>

  <p>During these three years we built the R&D function from the ground up. We established the laboratory, assembled the team, developed multiple material formulations, ran hundreds of experiments, produced pilot batches, commissioned equipment, and tested ideas under real manufacturing conditions.</p>

  <p>Not every experiment succeeded, and not every hypothesis proved correct. That's exactly how research works. What matters is that we built something real, delivered tangible results, and gained experience that will stay with all of us.</p>

</div>

<div class="modal-section">
  <h4 class="modal-section-title">How the team worked</h4>

  <p>More than anything, this project was about people.</p>

  <p>We worked with limited resources, constantly changing priorities, and objectives that were often still evolving while we were already solving them. Many solutions were developed on the fly, balancing scientific reasoning with practical engineering. It wasn't always easy, but the team kept moving forward and found a way through every challenge.</p>

</div>

<div class="modal-section modal-section--outcome">
  <h4 class="modal-section-title">The people who made it happen</h4>

  <p>I'd like to thank everyone who was part of this journey, and especially:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Aleksandra Nešić</strong> — you made an enormous contribution to the company and, personally, shared an incredible amount of knowledge with me.</li>

    <li><strong>Anja Bojinović</strong> and <strong>Filip Jovanović</strong> — without your work there would have been neither material development nor successful pilot production.</li>

    <li><strong>Stevan Andrić</strong> — your experience and judgement proved right more times than I can count.</li>

    <li><strong>Nemanja Stojanović</strong> — we started this journey together from day one. Building everything from scratch was an experience I'll always value.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Thank you to everyone who contributed. It was a privilege to work with you.</p>

</div>
  </div>
