<div class="modal-section modal-section--intro">
<p>I led the development of bark-filled biodegradable composites for rigid food packaging, including PBAT/PBS-based and thermoplastic-starch (TPS) material systems. The work covered matrix and filler selection, processing additives and iterative formulation trials.</p>

<p>Candidate materials were characterized and tested through twin-screw compounding, pelletizing, injection molding and thermoforming, with processing conditions adapted to the behavior of each formulation. Selected developments proceeded to pilot production and customer testing.</p>

</div>
